    "slug": "wolf-scouts",
    "legend": "Wolf Scouts are brooding stalkers and taciturn killers, at ease prowling behind enemy lines or at a battle’s edges. Commonly experienced battle-brothers rather than neophytes, Wolf Scouts employ patience and guile in their roles as reconnaissance experts and forward hunters, sniffing out isolated foes and falling upon them with fury.",
